      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup Checklist\n1. \"Config\" node mein apna real Zoho Mail address daalen (fromEmail)\n2. \"SMTP account\" credential confirm karen (smtp.zoho.com, port 465, SSL)\n3. Leads spreadsheet: \"n8n test emails\" > Sheet1 (columns: Emails, Email sent or unsent) — already linked hai\n4. Daily counter n8n Data Table \"ColdEmailDailyCounter\" mein track hota hai (already bana diya gaya hai)\n5. Timezone: America/Los_Angeles, 8am-8:30pm, har email ke darmiyan 60-240 sec random gap\n6. Ek hi fixed message (Ali Baig ke naam se) sab pending leads ko jayega",
