            },
            {
              "id": "body-f",
              "name": "body",
              "value": "Hi,\n\nMy good luck getting in touch with you!\n\nI'm Ali Baig, VP of Client Success at NorthBridge Data Solutions. We help global businesses with B2B lead generation and specialized data scraping.\n\nIn 2026, automated software alone won't keep you competitive — you need the \"hidden\" 20% of prospects that standard scrapers miss. Our team of 100+ specialists has successfully delivered high-volume data mining for US tech firms using manual, deep-research methods.\n\nThe NorthBridge Edge:\n\n- Transparency First: Clear communication and measurable results.\n- Top Rated on Upwork with a 100% Job Success Score.\n- Guaranteed: 95% data accuracy with a full bounce-back guarantee.\n- Zero Risk: Free custom lead sample. For new clients, we can deliver the work first and request payment only after you're satisfied.\n\nWe help businesses with: \n\n- Targeted outreach lists built from trade data, LinkedIn, and verified buyer sources.\n- Fast batch delivery so you can start engaging prospects immediately.\n- Strategic outreach backed by accurate data to improve campaign performance.\n\nAre you open to a brief chat to see how we can support your 2026 expansion?\n\nBest regards,\nAli Baig\nTop Rated-Verified Upwork Freelancer (100% Job Success)\nOwner | NorthBridge Data Solutions\n\nUpwork: https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~0154c798d3b6393001\nWhatsapp: +447460001196\nWebsite: https://www.northbridgedatasolutions.com/\n\n",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
